MODULE: TypeOKCallOutsideDomain
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an arriving call installs an invalid lifecycle state
PERTURBS: CallArrive

--- FIND
    /\ leaf' = [leaf EXCEPT ![l].call = "queued"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: invalid arrival lifecycle.
    /\ leaf' = [leaf EXCEPT ![l].call = "lost"]
--- END
